{
 "comment": [
  "The background lane's scored set: the measured footage index plus conditions asked for at hours, on days and in",
  "months the index does not cover. Every entry is in the same form as the index's own render clips (40 s since the",
  "start, 10 s, 1920 x 1080, seed 1, colour 0), so the numbers are comparable with the index's. scoreset.py resolves",
  "each one to a clip of the requested footage index and writes one index file for battery.py --index and",
  "bgfit/prep.py --index.",
  "Groups: 'shoulder' = hours between the four tuning hours, in the months the index covers; 'month' = the tuning",
  "hours in the eight months the index does not cover; 'alone' = the 4th of every month, inside the first week, where",
  "that month's images show alone and its own palette is all there is to see (spec 33, 34); 'alone-shoulder' = hours",
  "between them on the 4th, where the footage reaches; 'days' = the days through one month (April) at one fixed",
  "daytime hour, which is what pins the breadth of the mid-month lowering and where the month handover's step sits,",
  "neither of which a mid-month day and an end-of-month day can see between them (spec 34); 'midday' = frames an hour",
  "or so either side of the middle of the day, without which the breadth of the window over which the bottom glow",
  "broadens cannot be fitted at all (spec 34)."
 ],
